  .face .room-reading-ring { position: absolute; }
  .facecap { display: grid; justify-items: center; gap: 6px; font-family: var(--font-typewriter); font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: .1em; color: var(--color-ink-muted); text-transform: uppercase; }
  .film { display: flex; gap: 10px; }
  .frame { position: relative; width: 150px; height: 150px; display: grid; place-items: center; background: var(--color-paper-soft); border: 1px solid var(--color-paper-3); }
  .frame canvas { position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 150px; height: 150px; }
  .frame img { width: 92px; height: 92px; position: relative; opacity: .88; rotate: -4deg; }
  .frame span { position: absolute; bottom: 4px; left: 6px; font-family: var(--font-typewriter); font-size: 10px; color: var(--color-ink-muted); }
  .curve { background: var(--color-paper-soft); border: 1px solid var(--color-paper-3); }
  .mock-bar { display: inline-flex; gap: 14px; font-size: 12px; color: var(--color-ink-light); align-items: center; padding: 6px 10px; border: 1px solid var(--color-paper-3); background: var(--color-paper-2); }
  .popover-mock { position: relative; display: inline-block; }
  .selection-actions.static { position: relative; transform: none; left: auto; top: auto; z-index: 1; }
  .rule-host { position: relative; padding: 14px 10px 26px; background: var(--color-editor-bg); border: 1px solid var(--color-paper-3); font-family: var(--font-serif); }
  .rule-host .twyne-section-drop-rule { animation: none; }
  .slug-host { position: relative; height: 40px; }
  .slug-host .twyne-section-slug { position: absolute; top: 4px; left: 4px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="sheet">
  <h1>The living press, a specimen</h1>
  <p class="lede">Every piece below is the shipping CSS from src/styles, rendered statically. Theme: ${theme}.</p>
  <div class="grid">

    <section class="cell">
      <h2>Consequence</h2><h3>One ink, one mark, one word per destination</h3>
      <div class="row">
        <span class="destination-tag" data-consequence="local"><span class="destination-tag__mark"></span><span>device</span></span>
        <span class="destination-tag" data-consequence="synced"><span class="destination-tag__mark"></span><span>account</span></span>
        <span class="destination-tag" data-consequence="provider"><span class="destination-tag__mark"></span><span>model</span></span>
        <span class="destination-tag" data-consequence="credit"><span class="destination-tag__mark"></span><span>credit</span></span>
        <span class="destination-tag" data-consequence="public"><span class="destination-tag__mark"></span><span>public</span></span>
        <span class="destination-tag" data-consequence="erase"><span class="destination-tag__mark"></span><span>erases</span></span>
      </div>
      <div class="row" style="margin-top:14px">
        <button class="btn-press" data-consequence="credit">Grade this draft <span class="destination-tag" data-consequence="credit"><span class="destination-tag__mark"></span><span>credit</span></span></button>
        <button class="btn-press" data-consequence="public">Publish now <span class="destination-tag" data-consequence="public"><span class="destination-tag__mark"></span><span>public</span></span></button>
        <button class="btn-paper" data-consequence="provider">Send to editor <span class="destination-tag" data-consequence="provider"><span class="destination-tag__mark"></span><span>model</span></span></button>
      </div>
      <p class="note">Hollow ring: nothing leaves. Filled: a copy goes somewhere. Ring with a dot: seen from outside. Struck square: gone. The word is always there, so colour is never the only cue.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="cell">
      <h2>Permanent losses</h2><h3>Hold to confirm: the platen comes down</h3>
      <div class="row" style="padding-bottom:22px">
        <button class="hold-to-confirm btn-paper" data-consequence="erase"><span class="hold-to-confirm__ink"></span>Stop sharing</button>
        <button class="hold-to-confirm btn-paper" data-consequence="erase" data-holding style="--press-progress:.38"><span class="hold-to-confirm__ink"></span>Stop sharing<span class="hold-to-confirm__hint">hold to stop</span></button>
        <button class="hold-to-confirm btn-paper" data-consequence="erase" data-holding style="--press-progress:.82"><span class="hold-to-confirm__ink"></span>Stop sharing<span class="hold-to-confirm__hint">hold to stop</span></button>
        <button class="hold-to-confirm btn-paper" data-consequence="erase" data-armed><span class="hold-to-confirm__ink"></span>Stop sharing<span class="hold-to-confirm__hint">press again to confirm</span></button>
      </div>
      <p class="note">Rest, 40% and 90% held (ink eases in: slow to start, so a tap barely marks), and the keyboard's armed state. Releasing early drains the ink; a too-quick click nudges the slip into view.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="cell">
      <h2>The manuscript</h2><h3>Wet ink, the pencil caret, the proof-blue selection</h3>
      <p class="prose" style="margin:0">Morgan kept the ledger. <span class="drying">Every sack had a line,</span> <span class="wet">every line a price</span><span class="caret"></span></p>
      <p class="prose" style="margin:6px 0 0">Salt bought <span class="sel">silence in the hill towns.</span> A handful pressed…</p>
      <p class="note">Fresh words sit in a wetter cobalt-black until IndexedDB has them, pass through a drying tone, then are just ink. Painted with the Custom Highlight API: colour only, no DOM, no layout.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="cell">
      <h2>Where the words are</h2><h3>The status bar, in its consequence ink</h3>
      <div class="row">
        <span class="mock-bar"><span class="press-sync-status"><span>Saved 4s ago</span><span class="press-sync-route" data-consequence="local"><span class="press-sync-mark"></span>held here</span></span></span>
        <span class="mock-bar"><span class="press-sync-status"><span>Saved just now</span><span class="press-sync-route" data-consequence="synced"><span class="press-sync-mark"></span>on the wire</span></span></span>
        <span class="mock-bar"><span class="press-sync-status"><span>Saved 12s ago</span><span class="press-sync-route" data-consequence="synced" style="--flash-ink:var(--ink-synced);background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ink-synced) 22%,transparent)"><span class="press-sync-mark"></span>filed</span></span></span>
      </div>
      <p class="note">One line instead of a dot plus a timestamp. "Filed" flashes once in the account's green when it arrives; nothing pulses while the wire is busy.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="cell">
      <h2>An editor reading</h2><h3>A pencil ring that follows the real stream</h3>
      <div class="row" style="gap:26px">
        <span class="facecap"><span class="face"><svg class="room-reading-ring" viewBox="0 0 40 40" style="--reading-progress:.14"><circle cx="20" cy="20" r="18" pathLength="1"/></svg><img src="/assets/avatars/engraved-2026-09/owl.webp"></span>reasoning</span>
        <span class="facecap"><span class="face"><svg class="room-reading-ring" viewBox="0 0 40 40" style="--reading-progress:.58"><circle cx="20" cy="20" r="18" pathLength="1"/></svg><img src="/assets/avatars/engraved-2026-09/fox.webp"></span>writing</span>
        <span class="facecap"><span class="face"><svg class="room-reading-ring" viewBox="0 0 40 40" style="--reading-progress:.92"><circle cx="20" cy="20" r="18" pathLength="1"/></svg><img src="/assets/avatars/engraved-2026-09/hare.webp"></span>nearly filed</span>
        <span class="facecap"><span class="face"><span class="room-reading-ambient"></span><img src="/assets/avatars/engraved-2026-09/owl.webp"></span>room listening</span>
      </div>
      <p class="note">Replaces the spinning ✦. Reasoning traces at most a third of the ring; text advances it with the characters received, capped until the note is filed. "thinking…/writing…" stay as the still-mode words.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="cell">
