      <div class="slug-host"><div class="twyne-section-slug" style="position:absolute">The inland markets</div></div>
      <div class="rule-host">When the rains came early the pans flooded and the price doubled overnight.
        <span class="twyne-section-drop-rule" data-section-drop-label="The inland markets" style="margin-top:10px"></span>
      </div>
